          ≤ supWord ψ θ V W (2 * l.length) G + ENNReal.ofReal (4 * Real.pi ^ 2)⁻¹ *
              supWord ψ θ V W (2 * l.length) (derAlong ψ θ V W C a (derAlong ψ θ V W C a G)) := s1
        _ ≤ supWord ψ θ V W (2 * l.length + 1 + 1) G + ENNReal.ofReal (4 * Real.pi ^ 2)⁻¹ *
